  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/383",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">자료는 허접하지만<br>항상 많은 도움 받고있어서 공유합니다<br>생물전공은 아니라 틀린부분도있는것같지만<br>5단원자료가 재과만에 많지않은거같아서 <br>자료좀 보태봅니다^^<br>저희학교는 코로나로 40분씩 단축수업을 하고있어서<br>학습지 하나가 1차시로 끝나지못할때가 더 많았습니다.<br>적당히 반씩 나눠서 수업할때가 많았구요<br>학습지는 있는데 ppt는 없는건<br>칠판에 그려가며 수업한거에요<br>혈액순환같은 경우는 플루터로 출력해서<br>아이들에게 숫자스티커 나눠주고 함께 붙이고 그리며<br>정리했구요<br>배설계2는 그림이 비교적간단해서 그리면서 수업했습다 참고하세요^^<br>글씨체는 학습지는 md이솝체, ppt는 배달의민족 도현체라 글씨체가 안맞으면 파일이깨질수있어요^^<br>그럼 모두들 한주동안 수고하셨고<br>불금되세요<br>&#160;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fkFVenRmVVZDZXRPWmljclpGZ3Z1TG8yRlVsN2g2UFNzVmJkTVBKdkZTT3c?resourcekey=0-G-hy4axrRAxVBPCvGBurPA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fkFVenRmVVZDZXRPWmljclpGZ3Z1TG8yRlVsN2g2UFNzVmJkTVBKdkZTT3c?resourcekey=0-G-hy4axrRAxVBPCvGBurPA</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"5.동물과에너지(공유용) - Google Drive\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fkFVenRmVVZDZXRPWmljclpGZ3Z1TG8yRlVsN2g2UFNzVmJkTVBKdkZTT3c?resourcekey=0-G-hy4axrRAxVBPCvGBurPA\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fkFVenRmVVZDZXRPWmljclpGZ3Z1TG8yRlVsN2g2UFNzVmJkTVBKdkZTT3c?resourcekey=0-G-hy4axrRAxVBPCvGBurPA\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/GDuZU/dJMb85vPIJa/xu4IQfSpOCym3IcVMeWpKK/kakaolink40_original.png?width=48&amp;height=48\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fkFVenRmVVZDZXRPWmljclpGZ3Z1TG8yRlVsN2g2UFNzVmJkTVBKdkZTT3c?resourcekey=0-G-hy4axrRAxVBPCvGBurPA\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fkFVenRmVVZDZXRPWmljclpGZ3Z1TG8yRlVsN2g2UFNzVmJkTVBKdkZTT3c?resourcekey=0-G-hy4axrRAxVBPCvGBurPA\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/GDuZU/d